{"product_id":"halo-turkish-tobacco-e-liquid","title":"Halo Turkish Tobacco E liquid","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eTurkish tobacco gives a superb blend of sun-tobacco flavor with a very light, semi-sweet top note. This distinctive brand of e-liquid is reminiscent of the original Turkish tobacco, which is farmed inland from the Black Sea coast and is frequently combined with other tobaccos and used in conventional cigarettes. Turkish Tobacco E-liquids contain a very mild variety of tobacco, making \"light tobacco\" a great option for smokers who nevertheless want a noticeable sore throat and good steam production.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eBottle Size\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003e– 60mL Unicorn Bottle\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eAvailable Nicotine\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003e– 3mg , 6mg and 12mg \u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eVG\/PG Ratio \u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e– 70VG\/30PG\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Halo","offers":[{"title":"3MG","offer_id":41764766482487,"sku":"Halo Turkish Tobacco 3 Mg","price":2000.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"6MG","offer_id":41764766515255,"sku":"Halo Turkish Tobacco 6 MG","price":2000.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"12MG","offer_id":41764766548023,"sku":"Halo Turkish Tobacco 12 Mg","price":2000.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/Halo_Turkish_Tobacco_Eliquid-min.jpg?v=1751943439","url":"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/halo-turkish-tobacco-e-liquid","provider":"[YOUR BRAND]","version":"1.0","type":"link"}




